OL,15,     Fmake amends, Rose puts the second
OL,16,     Fstage of her plan into action,
OL,17,     Fputting Steve and Evan's futures
OL,18,     Fin jeopardy. Meanwhile, time is
OL,19,     Frunning out for Osian.
